---
title: Canvas account (local sign-in)
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> MustChangePassword : admin adds the person, one-time password
  MustChangePassword --> MustEnroll : new password set
  MustEnroll --> Active : authenticator confirmed
  Active --> Locked : three wrong passwords
  Locked --> Active : admin unlocks
  Active --> MustChangePassword : admin resets the password
  Active --> MustEnroll : admin resets two-step verification
  Active --> Deactivated : admin deactivates
  Deactivated --> Active : admin reactivates
  Active --> Deleted : admin deletes, content transferred
  Deactivated --> Deleted : admin deletes
  Deleted --> [*]
